  "body": "**Professionals Real Estate looks forward to welcoming you home.**\r\n\r\nPositioned in the highly sought-after Ara Hills community, 15 & 17 Tamaota Terrace presents an exciting opportunity to secure brand-new, thoughtfully designed homes in a growing neighbourhood. These modern house and land packages combine style, comfort, and practicality, making them ideal for families, first-home buyers, and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThese homes are designed to deliver effortless modern living, where open-plan spaces and quality finishes create a home that is both functional and inviting. Light-filled interiors, smart design, and low-maintenance living ensure everyday ease while still providing room to relax and entertain. \r\n\r\nFeaturing:\r\n* Master suite complete with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Three generously sized bedrooms plus study\r\n* High quality fixtures and fittings\r\n* Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n* Quality finishes throughout\r\n* Completion due within 2 months time with showhome available to view now.\r\n\r\n**Do you need to sell in order to purchase? There may be some flexibility with this listing - get in touch to discuss options.**\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for modern lifestyles, these homes offer the perfect balance of space and simplicity. Whether you're entertaining guests, raising a family, or investing for the future, this is an opportunity to secure a brand-new home in a location with strong long-term growth potential.\r\n\r\n**Buying an investment? Purchase this home and receive 3 months of free property management from our award winning team**\r\n\r\nLocated within the thriving Ara Hills subdivision, residents enjoy a peaceful setting surrounded by natural landscapes while remaining close to everyday conveniences. Orewa Beach, local cafés, shops, and quality schooling options are all within easy reach, with excellent transport links connecting you to wider Auckland.\r\n\r\nGet in touch with Sarah to find out more information including plans and specifications. \r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Photos used are of a similar property from the same developer. Specifications may differ from the final completed homes. We have a showhome to show you a completed home. Note: specifications can be subject to change during the construction stage. \r\n\r\n**Attention Agents: Bring your buyers - we offer competitive conjunctional rates to all agencies.**\r\n\r\n**Experienced. Trusted. Consistent. Local Professionals.**\r\n\r\n**If you are buying, selling, or looking for a better way to manage property, we would love to help. Backed by Meros Group, delivering a complete property solution - Sales, Rentals, Home Staging and Concierge.**",
